# Optional. Point this at a static-form backend (Formspree, Getform, Basin, or
# your own serverless endpoint) to receive Contact / Partner Inquiry form
# submissions. The site is statically exported, so there is no built-in API
# route — see src/lib/forms.ts. Without this set, forms fall back to a
# mailto: link so submissions are never silently lost.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORM_ENDPOINT=
